  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indo-Pacific Media Resilience (IPMR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To strengthen societal resilience to foreign information manipulation and interference (FIMI) operations, by increasing the capacity of local media and fostering a network of professional journalists for mutual support and exchange of journalistic best practices, fact-checking and tackling FIMI.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
